<![CDATA[<div style=""><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hello,</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thank you for contacting Zeta Charter Schools!</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We've received your inquiry, "{!Case.Subject}", and our dedicated Family Outreach &amp; Enrollment Team will personally review it to ensure it receives the attention it deserves. If needed, you can use ID {!Case.CaseNumber} when referencing this request.</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We are honored to support your family's journey.</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11.36px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sincerely,<br><br></span><table style="color: rgb(80, 0, 80); border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><tbody><tr style="height: 78pt;"><td style="margin: 0px; border-right: 1.5pt solid rgb(116, 209, 234); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline;"><br